  "Description": [
    "Python API for the Google Fonts protobuf metadata definitions gfmetadata provides Python bindings for the Protocol Buffer definitions used across the Google Fonts collection: font families (METADATA.pb), axes, designers, languages/regions/scripts and the knowledge base. It also re-exports google.protobuf.text_format so that tools can parse and emit the text-format protobuf files found in the google/fonts repository with a single import."
